    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31929" root="غصن" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُصْنٌ</span></b>  <i>A branch from the stem</i> [or <i>from another
branch</i>] <i>of a tree; of the slender thereof</i> as well
as <i>of the thick:</i> (K:) [sometimes signifying <i>a
twig,</i> or <i>shoot:</i>] pl. [of pauc.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَغْصَانٌ</span> and [of
mult.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُصُونٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِصَنَةٌ</span>. (S, K.)

